<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;">Your certificate is here 🎉</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Dear {{firstName}}, thank you for the time and heart you gave to the <strong>{{programName}}</strong> programme.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;margin:0 0 16px;border:1px solid rgba(31,43,54,.10);border-radius:12px;">
  <tr><td style="padding:14px 16px;">
    <p style="margin:0;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;">Certificate {{certificateNumber}}</p>
    <p style="margin:8px 0 0;font-size:14px;">⏱ {{hours}} hours contributed<br>📅 {{eventsAttended}} session(s) attended</p>
  </td></tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Your certificate of appreciation is attached to this email as a PDF. It is also available any time in your volunteer dashboard.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;">{{> button url=walletUrl label="View my certificates"}}</p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#5E6E7E;font-size:13px;">We hope to see you at the next session — communities are built one volunteer at a time.</p>

{{#if mementoNote}}
<p style="margin:12px 0 0;color:#3d4744;">A small token of appreciation awaits you as well: <strong>{{mementoNote}}</strong> — your coordinator will hand it over at the next session.</p>
{{/if}}
